# Cloudflare Workers Builds — set these in the dashboard too
# Build command: npm run deploy
# Or: npx opennextjs-cloudflare build && npx opennextjs-cloudflare deploy -- --keep-vars
# Deploy command can be empty if build already deploys.
#
# Required build + runtime vars:
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
